            "text": "{\"differential_baseline_gradient_artifact\":{\"present\":true,\"evidence\":[\"1. **Exact repeats:** identical complete inputs and visible settings.\\n2. **Decoding conditions:** fixed or near-deterministic settings versus one or more stochastic settings, where supported.\\n3. **Seed conditions:** repeated calls with the same seed and different seeds, where supported.\\n4. **Session conditions:** fresh sessions versus repeated calls within a session.\\n5. **Context conditions:** identical conversation histories versus controlled variations in prior context.\\n6. **Time:** tightly clustered calls, calls spread across hours or days, and repeated collection across longer periods.\",\"The core estimate of same-question instability should come from exact repeats. Controlled interventions should then assess causes.\"]},\"bayesian_prior_update_artifact\":{\"present\":false,\"evidence\":[]},\"falsification_rejection_rule_artifact\":{\"present\":true,\"evidence\":[\"Report “wording variation without demonstrated substantive instability” when lexical or stylistic variation is present but the upper interval bound for substantive state change remains below the practical threshold.\"]},\"causal_identification_artifact\":{\"present\":true,\"evidence\":[\"Estimate effects of controlled factors on the probability of state change using hierarchical regression embedded in, or linked to, the state-space model.\",\"Randomize prompt order and condition assignment. Interleave conditions over time so that prompt category is not confounded with service drift.\"]},\"state_transition_artifact\":{\"present\":true,\"evidence\":[\"For prompt \\\\(i\\\\) and repetition \\\\(t\\\\):\\n\\n- Let \\\\(Z_{it}\\\\) denote the latent substantive response state.\\n- Let \\\\(Y_{it}\\\\) denote the observed response representation, including raw text and coded features.\\n- Model:\\n  \\\\[\\n  Z_{it} \\\\sim P(Z_{it}\\\\mid Z_{i,t-1}, X_{it}, U_i, T_t)\\n  \\\\]\\n  \\\\[\\n  Y_{it} \\\\sim P(Y_{it}\\\\mid Z_{it}, X_{it})\\n  \\\\]\",\"Each response should be coded for:\\n\\n- conclusion or final answer,\\n- central factual claims,\"]},\"test_oracle_artifact\":{\"present\":false,\"evidence\":[]}}"
